        // Each input value is loaded once from shared memory and reused
        // across all OC_TILE output channels; the OC_TILE weights for each
        // (c, widx) position are contiguous in shared memory and fetched
        // with OC_TILE/4 vectorized float4 broadcast loads, then reused
        // across this thread's REG_H x REG_W outputs.
